{"unit_id":"LvienOeria__dsh-quest#card-zh","repo":"LvienOeria/dsh-quest","commit":"ae4f5e43af51d529ebbe3fa1ab8420555f720943","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-quest（新求索）是 DeepSeek Harness 网页端的创作探索插件。它在侧栏提供新求索入口，创建带探索深度标记的会话，并自动注入对应开场提示。对话中可逐题探索兴趣，查看提问进度并提前结束，最后由 Agent 汇总创意方向。设置页支持调整各深度的提示模板、目标题量和默认深度。适合尚未明确创作主题、希望通过访谈获得灵感的用户；需要安装包含配套核心改动的 Harness。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:720-779","index.js:89-128"]}
{"unit_id":"LvienOeria__dsh-quest#card-en","repo":"LvienOeria/dsh-quest","commit":"ae4f5e43af51d529ebbe3fa1ab8420555f720943","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-quest guides creative exploration in DeepSeek Harness. Choose an interview depth to open a marked session with a matching prompt. The agent adapts questions to answers and suggests ideas. Track progress, finish early, and customize prompts and counts. Requires the companion Harness core patch.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:720-779","index.js:89-128"]}
